## What We Provide, and What We Don't

Sound, lighting, microphones, projectors and screens make up our five packages. What is not in the catalog: cameras, live streaming gear, video conferencing hardware, or a modular LED wall. The biggest screen we run is a single 60 inch LED unit on the MICE Pack.

