## FAQs

### Is Malaga Event Gear a real, established audio visual rental company?

Yes, operating in Malaga since 1996, with a 5.0 average across 8 Google reviews.

### Does Malaga Event Gear provide a technician, or is that extra?

Technician inclusion follows the package you choose: the Wedding Pack and the MICE Pack both come with one built in, the Basic MICE Pack lets you add one for an extra fee, and neither the Eco Pack nor the Product Presentation Pack carries a technician.

### How much does Malaga Event Gear charge to rent AV equipment?

Prices start at 290 euros and top out at 650 euros, ex VAT, before the 21 percent Spanish VAT is added at checkout. Delivery, setup and teardown are already built into every one of those figures. Full pricing by package is on our [packages page](/packages/).

### What events does Malaga Event Gear cover?

Guest capacity scales with the package: up to 40 on the Basic MICE Pack, 50 on the Eco Pack, 80 on the Wedding Pack, and 120 on the MICE Pack.

### Does Malaga Event Gear deliver and set up the equipment, or do I collect it myself?

We deliver, install and test every package ourselves, then collect it again after your event. This is not a self-collect model.

### What areas does Malaga Event Gear serve?

Malaga and 23 towns across the Costa del Sol, extending to Sevilla and Granada for larger bookings.

### How far in advance should I book Malaga Event Gear?

A minimum of 24 hours notice guarantees your slot. We are based in Malaga, with delivery extending to Granada once the booking passes 400 euros.
